          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='79340' id='5' type-v2='text' w='48169' x='51245' y='19618'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>- Not just one disease: </run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Cancer is a complex group of hundreds of different pathologies, not a single condition.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>- Genetic uniqueness: </run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Every tumor has a unique genetic profile that evolves differently in each patient.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>- The Limitation of Generalization:</run>
              <run fontsize='12'> Standard treatments often fail because they don&apos;t account for individual biological differences.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>- The Shift to Precision:</run>
              <run fontsize='12'> Personalized medicine is the only way to improve outcomes, requiring us to integrate pharmacology, nutrition, and lifestyle data.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
